$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=boxcnt  LOC_AFTER=?

* Box count from square counts (Lean ` box_count_core ` ): if every square of half-side ` 13 / 8 ` about ` 2 + i t ` carries weight at most ` K log ( A ( abs t + 2 ) ) ` of the finite set ` G ` of points of ` [ 1 / 2 , 1 ] x. [ - T , T ] ` , ` T >_ 1 ` , then ` G ` carries at most ` 4 T K 2 log ( A ( T + 2 ) ) ` : the fibres of ` q |-> floor ( Im q ) ` lie in the squares at heights ` m + 1 / 2 ` ( ~ fsumiun , ~ invdisjrab ).

